    <h3>Build 1: ask for an observable action</h3><p class="tile-target">Request a 3:00 update only when the deadline is at risk.</p>
    <div class="tile-bank" data-build-bank><button class="tile" data-build-tile="deadline">deadline</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="an">an</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="risk">risk</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="could">Could</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="at">at</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="send">send</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="when">when</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="is">is</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="the">the</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="you">you</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="by">by</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="update">update</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="three">three</button></div>
